  "known_parity_gaps": [
    "GAP-repair-package-register-not-called: Python repair/__init__.py calls register_all_conservative_recipes(), register_all_salvage_recipes(), and register_all_sl002_recipes() at import time. Rust exposes the three register_all aliases but does not invoke them at crate load.",
    "GAP-repair-package-string-exports: PRECONDITION_FUNCS, REGISTRY, and run_all_checks appear in Python __all__ and in repair::ALL as names only; they are not re-exported as public Rust values and run_all_checks is not a Rust function.",
    "GAP-repair-submodule-apis: repair submodules have dedicated module parity vectors; a name in __all__ does not count as barrel behavioral coverage for this card."
